<title>HUNGARY: FERENCVAROS BEATS NEWCASTLE 3-2.</title>
<headline>FERENCVAROS BEATS NEWCASTLE 3-2.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ferencvaros beat Newcastle United 3-2 (2-2) in the UEFA Cup second round first leg match in Budapest on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ferencvaros: Ferenc Horvath (5th), Krisztian Lisztes (15th, 55th)</p>
<p>Newcastle: Les Ferdinand (23rd) Alan Shearer (34th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 17,000</p>
</text>
